                  "content": "Each product gets its own flat brand colour. One cropped piece of real UI sits on it, cut by the bottom edge so it reads as a slice of the product, not a mockup. The fragment is the moment that defines the product: the take-a-side buttons, the allocation donut, the AC devices, the service picker.",
