                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Crops are image fills on a clipped frame (native px x scale). Export each 640x400 thumb from Pencil at 2x, then cwebp -q 85 -resize 512 0 into public/work/<slug>/thumb.webp. Set invert: true on light thumbs so the site dither keeps polarity.",
