                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "+ Strong colour at 128x80, the four rows no longer look alike. + Real product, still calm. + Crops chosen to hold no customer data. - Fragment detail is tiny at row size; colour carries it. - Brand colours are loud next to a quiet page, so the dither resting state matters.",
