          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The phone stays put on the right while you read on the left, and it changes clip as each section reaches the top third of the screen. Each heading carries a small mono tag saying which clip it drives. The page reads like a narrated demo: text explains, the phone shows. Meta becomes four quiet columns.",
