          "content": "Written for the engineer who is hiring. The page leads with the hard problem and a real figure, then the build as numbered notes with the language each one is in, and only then the screens, as context. Meta moves to a colophon at the end. Reads like a short technical post (Raycast, Emil Kowalski), not a showcase.",
