                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "FSMmD",
                  "name": "Body",
                  "fill": "$prose",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "No screenshot at all. Each thumb redraws one detail at poster size on the product's own surface colour: Sway's Bearish and Bullish buttons, Cerebro's allocation ring, BenKon's set temperature and AC switch, GreenMaster's four service types. Same grid, same Geist, same centred placement, so they read as a set while the detail gives each its character.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Geist",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "S2iXb",
              "name": "Production",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "children": [
