        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "a32B2",
          "name": "One large phone, and the",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One large phone, and the stack written onto it. Each note points at the part of the screen a piece of my work powers: the live price is the Rust traffic controller, the totals are the trade feed, the creator is the on-chain rewards, the buttons are the Expo app. It shows front end and back end in one picture, which is the full-stack claim made visible. The list below uses the same numbers.",
          "lineHeight": "$leading-list",
          "fontFamily": "$ui",
          "fontSize": "$text-list",
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
